"FLINK-29095": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-29095",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Improve logging in SharedStateRegistry ",
    "description": "with the incremental checkpoint, conceptually, state files that are never used by any checkpoint will be deleted/GC . In practices, state files might be deleted when they are still somehow required by the failover which will lead to Flink job fails.\r\n\r\nWe should add the log for trouble shooting.  ",
